<h3>{{ _('PrusaLink Connector') }}</h3>
<p>
    Connect OctoPrint to a Prusa printer over its local PrusaLink API. After saving, pick the
    <code>PRUSALINK</code> serial port in the Connection panel (any baud rate).
</p>

<form class="form-horizontal" onsubmit="return false;">
    <div class="control-group">
        <label class="control-label">{{ _('Printer host / IP') }}</label>
        <div class="controls">
            <input type="text" class="input-block-level" placeholder="192.168.1.50 or http://mk4.local:80" data-bind="value: settings.plugins.prusalink.host">
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="control-group">
        <label class="control-label">{{ _('Username') }}</label>
        <div class="controls">
            <input type="text" class="input-medium" data-bind="value: settings.plugins.prusalink.username">
            <span class="help-inline">{{ _('Digest auth user, usually "maker"') }}</span>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="control-group">
        <label class="control-label">{{ _('Password') }}</label>
        <div class="controls">
            <input type="password" class="input-medium" autocomplete="new-password" data-bind="value: settings.plugins.prusalink.password">
            <span class="help-inline">{{ _('Printer display: Settings → Network → PrusaLink') }}</span>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="control-group">
        <label class="control-label">{{ _('API key (legacy)') }}</label>
        <div class="controls">
            <input type="password" class="input-medium" autocomplete="off" data-bind="value: settings.plugins.prusalink.api_key">
            <span class="help-inline">{{ _('Only for older firmware using X-Api-Key. Overrides user/password.') }}</span>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="control-group">
        <div class="controls">
            <label class="checkbox"><input type="checkbox" data-bind="checked: settings.plugins.prusalink.use_https"> {{ _('Use HTTPS') }}</label>
            <label class="checkbox"><input type="checkbox" data-bind="checked: settings.plugins.prusalink.verify_tls"> {{ _('Verify TLS certificate') }}</label>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="control-group">
        <label class="control-label">{{ _('Storage') }}</label>
        <div class="controls">
            <input type="text" class="input-small" placeholder="auto" data-bind="value: settings.plugins.prusalink.storage">
            <span class="help-inline">{{ _('e.g. usb, local, sdcard. Blank = first writable.') }}</span>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="control-group">
        <label class="control-label">{{ _('Poll interval') }}</label>
        <div class="controls">
            <div class="input-append">
                <input type="number" step="0.5" min="0.5" class="input-mini" data-bind="value: settings.plugins.prusalink.poll_interval">
                <span class="add-on">s</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="control-group">
        <label class="control-label">{{ _('Request timeout') }}</label>
        <div class="controls">
            <div class="input-append">
                <input type="number" step="1" min="1" class="input-mini" data-bind="value: settings.plugins.prusalink.request_timeout">
                <span class="add-on">s</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="control-group">
        <div class="controls">
            <label class="checkbox">
                <input type="checkbox" data-bind="checked: settings.plugins.prusalink.redirect_local_prints">
                {{ _('Printing a file from OctoPrint storage uploads it to the printer and prints from there') }}
            </label>
            <span class="help-block">{{ _('Requires an OctoPrint restart to change whether the redirect is installed.') }}</span>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="control-group">
        <div class="controls">
            <button class="btn" data-bind="click: testConnection, enable: !testing()">
                <i class="fa fa-spinner fa-spin" data-bind="visible: testing"></i> {{ _('Test connection') }}
            </button>
            <span data-bind="text: testResult, css: {'text-success': testOk(), 'text-error': !testOk()}"></span>
        </div>
    </div>

    <h4>{{ _('Timelapse') }}</h4>
    <p class="help-block">
        {{ _('OctoPrint\'s built-in timelapse and Octolapse need G-code streaming, which PrusaLink can\'t do. This records a timelapse itself and renders it into OctoPrint\'s Timelapse tab using OctoPrint\'s webcam and ffmpeg settings. Turn OctoPrint\'s own timelapse off.') }}
    </p>
    <div class="control-group">
        <label class="control-label">{{ _('Mode') }}</label>
        <div class="controls">
            <select data-bind="value: settings.plugins.prusalink.timelapse_mode">
                <option value="off">{{ _('Off') }}</option>
                <option value="stabilized">{{ _('Stabilized (park head each layer)') }}</option>
                <option value="layer">{{ _('Layer change (no parking)') }}</option>
            </select>
            <span class="help-block">{{ _('Stabilized edits ASCII .gcode as it is uploaded through OctoPrint, adding a park and pause at each layer change. Those files park whenever they are printed, including from the printer screen. Binary .bgcode can\'t be edited.') }}</span>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div data-bind="visible: settings.plugins.prusalink.timelapse_mode() !== 'off'">
        <div class="control-group">
            <div class="controls">
                <label class="checkbox">
                    <input type="checkbox" data-bind="checked: settings.plugins.prusalink.timelapse_fallback_layer">
                    {{ _('Files without parks (.bgcode, sent directly to the printer): record on layer change instead') }}
                </label>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="control-group">
            <label class="control-label">{{ _('Snapshot URL') }}</label>
            <div class="controls">
                <input type="text" class="input-block-level" placeholder="{{ _('blank = OctoPrint snapshot webcam') }}" data-bind="value: settings.plugins.prusalink.timelapse_snapshot_url">
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="control-group">
            <label class="control-label">{{ _('Fast poll while recording') }}</label>
            <div class="controls">
                <div class="input-append">
                    <input type="number" step="0.25" min="0.25" class="input-mini" data-bind="value: settings.plugins.prusalink.timelapse_poll_interval">
                    <span class="add-on">s</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="control-group">
            <label class="control-label">{{ _('Post roll') }}</label>
            <div class="controls">
                <div class="input-append">
                    <input type="number" step="0.5" min="0" class="input-mini" data-bind="value: settings.plugins.prusalink.timelapse_post_roll">
                    <span class="add-on">s</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div data-bind="visible: settings.plugins.prusalink.timelapse_mode() === 'stabilized'">
        <div class="control-group">
            <label class="control-label">{{ _('Park position X / Y') }}</label>
            <div class="controls">
                <input type="number" step="1" class="input-mini" placeholder="auto" data-bind="value: settings.plugins.prusalink.park_x">
                <input type="number" step="1" class="input-mini" placeholder="auto" data-bind="value: settings.plugins.prusalink.park_y">
                <span class="help-inline">{{ _('mm. Blank = back right, 10 mm in, from the printer profile') }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="control-group">
            <label class="control-label">{{ _('Z lift / retract') }}</label>
            <div class="controls">
                <input type="number" step="0.1" min="0" class="input-mini" data-bind="value: settings.plugins.prusalink.park_lift">
                <input type="number" step="0.1" min="0" class="input-mini" data-bind="value: settings.plugins.prusalink.park_retract">
                <span class="help-inline">mm</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="control-group">
            <label class="control-label">{{ _('Travel / Z / retract speed') }}</label>
            <div class="controls">
                <input type="number" step="100" min="1" class="input-mini" data-bind="value: settings.plugins.prusalink.park_travel_speed">
                <input type="number" step="10" min="1" class="input-mini" data-bind="value: settings.plugins.prusalink.park_z_speed">
                <input type="number" step="100" min="1" class="input-mini" data-bind="value: settings.plugins.prusalink.park_retract_speed">
                <span class="help-inline">mm/min</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="control-group">
            <label class="control-label">{{ _('Pause while parked') }}</label>
            <div class="controls">
                <div class="input-append">
                    <input type="number" step="100" min="500" class="input-mini" data-bind="value: settings.plugins.prusalink.park_dwell_ms">
                    <span class="add-on">ms</span>
                </div>
                <span class="help-inline">{{ _('Must be longer than the fast poll interval plus snapshot time') }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="control-group">
            <label class="control-label">{{ _('Every N layers') }}</label>
            <div class="controls">
                <input type="number" step="1" min="1" class="input-mini" data-bind="value: settings.plugins.prusalink.park_every_n_layers">
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="control-group">
            <label class="control-label">{{ _('Marker speed') }}</label>
            <div class="controls">
                <div class="input-append">
                    <input type="number" step="1" min="10" max="255" class="input-mini" data-bind="value: settings.plugins.prusalink.park_marker_speed">
                    <span class="add-on">%</span>
                </div>
                <span class="help-inline">{{ _('M220 value set while parked so the plugin can tell the head is parked; restored after. Don\'t use this speed yourself.') }}</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</form>
